{"id":"vod_bf_173629","vodId":"173629","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"兽之奏者艾琳","name_cn":"兽之奏者艾琳","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfp261112.com/upload/vod/20261118-1/ae4ec3fb3716dff2e17f8a796603c07d.webp"},"summary":"艾琳（星井七濑 配音）的母亲是一名兽医，两人过着相依为命的生活。一场意外的发生令母亲和艾琳即将遭受残酷的死刑折磨，在生死存亡的紧要关头，母亲用禁断的咒术救了艾琳，自己则不幸死在了猛兽的口中。 就这样，艾琳失去了自己在这世界上的唯一一个亲人，善良的养蜂老人约翰收留了无处可 去的她，将她抚养成人。一次偶然中，艾琳邂逅了在天空中自由翱翔的王兽，王兽是一种高傲的物种，绝不受人类的亲近和控制，这种高洁的性格深深的吸引了艾琳，引导着艾琳走上了和母亲一样的道路。艾琳来到了位于卡扎姆的王兽保护场，开始了学习，没想到这一选择彻底改变了她的命运。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-11-18 22:38:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/cc1cf1d7e5ee/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/57ddd0b49e82/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/d44966608107/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/b6c6d99f4ebb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/52692d2632cd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/f636e0ed4542/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/0280ef2006da/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/582eeb1e87fd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/29c690c24aaf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/2526be851db1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/5eb47469b0d7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/video/shouzhizouzheailin/f46fea3b6a2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.fengbao14.com/vide